          "The Capital Allocation Gateway automates three foundational governance workflows: Workflow 1: Multi-Tier Project Underwriting & Hurdle Rate Enforcement: evaluating business unit capital expenditure requests against risk-calibrated hurdle rates, computing net present values, and applying profitability index ranking under capital rationing constraints. Workflow 2: Corporate ROIC-WACC Economic Spread & Value Creation Telemetry: auditing enterprise invested capital, computing unlevered NOPAT, tracking annual economic profit generation, and verifying that capital deployment creates genuine shareholder wealth rather than destructive empire-building.",
