        "output": "=== OFFICE SCRIPTS TYPESCRIPT EXECUTION ENGINE ===\nWorkbook: Global_Financial_Consolidation.xlsx | Script: UpdateExecutiveFpaSummary\nTarget Sheet: MOR_Summary | Total Cells Committed: 25\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDepartment                 | HC   | Q1 Budget ($)  | Q1 Actual ($)  | Variance\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nEngineering                |  120 | $4,500,000.00 | $4,320,000.00 |   -4.0%\nCommercial Sales           |   85 | $3,200,000.00 | $3,450,000.00 |   +7.8%\nCorporate Treasury         |   25 | $1,100,000.00 | $1,080,000.00 |   -1.8%\nManufacturing Operations   |  210 | $6,800,000.00 | $7,150,000.00 |   +5.1%\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nExecution Telemetry:\n  * [TS-RUNTIME] CREATE_SHEET: MOR_Summary\n  * [TS-RUNTIME] BATCH_WRITE: MOR_Summary!A1:END (5x5 cells)\n"
